    "body": "**Affected versions**:\n\n\n* All;\n\n**Affected FxA versions**:\n\n\n* 1.220.0;\n\n**Prerequisites**:\n\n\n* Be in a Mozilla VPN EU supported country;\n* Have the browser language or system language set to one of the following languages: Fr/De/Es/It/Nl;\n* Be on new Set up your Subscription page;\n\n**Steps to reproduce**:\n1. Observe the “Privacy Notice” label link;\n\n**Expected result**:\n\n\n* The “Privacy Notice” label link is displayed in the user language;\n\n**Actual result**:\n\n\n* The “Privacy Notice” label link is displayed in English, regardless of the user language;\n\n**Notes**:\n\n\n* This is reproducible on Subscription confirmation page as well;\n* When clicking on the “Privacy Notice” link, the Privacy Notice page is displayed in the user language;\n* See the attached screenshot.\n\n┆Issue is synchronized with this [Jira Bug](https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/browse/FXA-4267)\n┆Attachments: <a href=\"https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/22404\">image_2022_04_01T14_32_22_564Z.png</a> | <a href=\"https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/18219\">Schermafbeelding 2021-11-25 om 17.13.40.png</a> | <a href=\"https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/22623\">Screen Shot 2022-04-06 at 1.53.57 PM (2).png</a> | <a href=\"https://mozilla-hub.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/22860\">Screen Shot 2022-04-14 at 12.47.27.png</a>\n",
